[00:00.00]
[00:26.69]I just got off the phone with you
[00:31.12]you found someone to be with you
[00:35.68]my heart is sinking with love for you still
[00:40.08]I won't survive it, no-one will
[00:44.56]we won't be secret Italy
[00:49.59]sharing hotel beds
[00:51.23]sneaking sleepily
[00:53.71]into the meshy fog in the fields
[00:56.40]with the dogs and the hawks
[00:58.96]and those tiny lizards sunning on the rocks
[01:02.50]
[01:24.69]you call me up from strippers' laps
[01:29.52]texting me their photographs
[01:33.89]you tell me you love me
[01:36.36]and I love you back
[01:38.40]you tell me I'm cool and this is a fact
[01:42.80]Tonight I drink until I'm dead
[01:47.12]or at least unconscious in my head
[01:52.00]I don't want to dream the night my empire falls
[01:56.50]you razed everything and took it all
[02:08.60]my empire falls
[02:13.00]through dream soaked walls
[02:17.60]my empire falls
[02:31.20]through dream soaked walls
[02:36.20]my empire falls
[02:40.40]through dream soaked walls
[02:45.20]my empire falls
